## Model card

- **Name:** Gemini 2.5 Flash-Lite
- **Short description:** Google's lean Gemini 2.5 lane (released 2025-06-17) for cheap multimodal traffic and quick agents, with a 1M context.
- **Provider / access:** Google Gemini API / AI Studio (`gemini-2.5-flash-lite`), Vertex AI, SAP AI Core, Merge Gateway, Kenari, Qiniu, plus ~23 routes.
- **Release / knowledge:** 2025-06-17; knowledge cutoff 2025-01 (models.dev).
- **IDs:** `gemini-2.5-flash-lite`, `google/gemini-2.5-flash-lite`, `opencode/gemini-2.5-flash-lite`.
- **Context window:** 1,048,576 tokens (1M on Merge Gateway); max output 65,536.
- **Modalities:** text, image, audio, video and PDF in; text out; thinking and tool calls.
- **Pricing (as of 2026-11-11/12):** $0.10 / $0.40 per 1M input/output; cache read $0.01.
- **Architecture:** proprietary sparse MoE (undisclosed).

