## Search notes (why self-excluded)

- BenchLM has no Flash-Lite profile: `benchlm.ai/models/gemini-2-5-flash-lite` silently serves the **Gemini 2.5 Flash** (non-Lite) profile instead — 2 rows, a different checkpoint, deliberately not used here.
- llm-stats.com/models/gemini-2.5-flash-lite and benchgap.net list the model but render their tables client-side; no primary figure is present in the served HTML (benchgap claims 14 measured benchmarks but shows none).
- benchleader.com gives only a composite (BenchLeader Index 48.3 ±6.1, rank #413 of 759) — a composite, not a benchmark row, and not usable as evidence for any dimension.
- models.dev carries the model (release, context, price, modalities) but no benchmark fields.
- Resolution: spec facts above are catalog-verified; the benchmark columns stay empty until a primary per-benchmark figure is reachable.

